cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "session-flow: a Claude Code plugin for session workflow orchestration"
message: "If you use session-flow, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: hoponthestack
    name: matshoppenbrouwers
repository-code: "https://github.com/matshoppenbrouwers/session-flow"
url: "https://github.com/matshoppenbrouwers/session-flow"
abstract: >-
  session-flow is a Claude Code plugin that orchestrates the full software
  development lifecycle through a chain of 13 skills and 4 agents — research,
  design, task planning, agent delegation, post-implementation, evidence-based
  verification, and release — with dependency-aware parallelization, a standing
  task backlog, and a security & liability audit.
